    "text": "By Ron Fonger ,\n10 hours ago FLINT, MI -- Flint City Council hearings on departmental budgets start today, Wednesday, April 1, as members take an initial step toward adopting a City Hall spending plan for the fiscal year that begins July 1. The hearings start a week after Mayor Sheldon Neeley proposed a general fund budget... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
